   T'Day name by the copyright holder.

   "Personal Use" means use by a natural person for their own purposes, or for
   family members and others in their household, on infrastructure that person
   controls, and without charge. Use by or on behalf of a company, government
   body, school, non-profit or any other organisation is not Personal Use.

   "Instance" means a running deployment of the Software.


